/images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczt4x.jpg"}, {"id": 1670725, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczt51.jpg"}, {"id": 1670723, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczt4z.jpg"}, {"id": 1670724, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczt50.jpg"}, {"id": 1670722, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sczt4y.jpg"}], "slug": "apsulov-end-of-gods", "storyline": "The humans delved far beneath the earth to find the mercy of the gods. What they found was never meant to reach the surface. Not on Mi\u00f0gar\u00f0r, nor any of the nine realms of Yggdrasil. Now their discovery wreaks havoc on their world, exploiting their technology, and leaving all in misery and decay. Through all their conquests and revelations they never stopped to consider that some things are buried for a reason.\n\nIn a world of technology and mythological artifacts, chaos rules over the human realm. It is in this chaos that you find your purpose and destiny.\n\nIn this future viking horror, Alice, the game's main heroine, awake in a sanctuary of steel and concrete, built to research and exploit the worlds of Yggdrasil, and to house an artifact, buried in the earth aeons ago.", "summary": "You awake in a sanctuary of steel and concrete, built to honor the Nordic Gods and to house an artifact, buried in the earth aeons ago. Unveil the secrets of the inhabitants, the artifact, and the nine realms of Yggdrasil in Apsulov: End of Gods.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/apsulov-end-of-gods", "videos": [{"id": 29065, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "lZsBCnAxGZU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lZsBCnAxGZU", "title": "Apsulov: End of Gods - Official Announcement Trailer [2019]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lZsBCnAxGZU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 22754, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "xDhM543sB1o"}]}